Unrestricted (T) triples tiles

The real spin-orbital connected/disconnected seed expressions in
generativeqc_compiler.cc.uccsd_triples are adapted from PySCF 2.14.0
pyscf/cc/gccsd_t.py. The independent per-spin-channel oracle is
pyscf/cc/uccsd_t_slow.py. Author credited by both upstream files: Qiming Sun.
The existing PySCF Apache-2.0 notice and LICENSE.pyscf apply. Exact upstream
URLs and SHA-256 values are recorded in uccsd_triples_source_manifest.json.

GenerativeQC modifications: expand the occupied/virtual cyclic sums, eliminate
forbidden spin assignments at graph construction, retain explicit physical
mixed-spin signs, use exact channel multiplicities, and expose offset-independent
tile-input bindings for shared CPU/CUDA TensorIR and subsequent cotangents.
